[i]Hi, chefs! We need your help cooking! [/i]

Today we’ve launched a playtest of Abra-Cooking-Dabra. This means you can be among the first players to try the game! What’s more, you can also influence the development process - by answering questions in our survey in the main menu of the game.

To take part in the playtest just press a button on [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3021530/AbraCookingDabra/]Abra-Cooking-Dabra[/url] Steam page.

The playtest version offers:
[list]
[*] 4 levels;
[*] 1 boss-level;
[*] 3 common guests;
[*] 2 secret guests;
[*] 2 bosses.
[/list]Keep note that in the playtest version bugs may occur - this is normal for a game in active development and we are working tirelessly to iron them out.

[i]Yours, the Door 407 dev team[/i]
